        // Reference: Alice's balance after Put(2) - Collect(1) = 1 ether
        // Buggy: Alice's balance after Put(2 halved to 1) - Collect(1) = 0 ether, but halving occurs on Put, so balance = 1 ether put, then collect 1 => 0 ether? No, buggy: Put(2) -> balance += 1, balance=1; Collect(1) -> balance becomes 0. Wait, the scenario must show divergence differently.
